sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Client
    participant A as Quotes service
    participant D as PostgreSQL
    C->>A: POST amount 10000.00, rate stub 4.25
    A->>D: INSERT amount NUMERIC(19,4)
    A-->>C: 201 {"amount":10000.00,"annualRatePercent":4.25}
    C->>A: GET /quotes/{id}
    A->>D: SELECT
    D-->>A: 10000.0000, 4.2500
    A-->>C: 200 {"amount":10000.0000,"annualRatePercent":4.2500}
    Note over C: Same quote, two different JSON documents
